orenew</span><div><div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest\">Billing Cycle</div><div class=\"text-white font-semibold text-lg\">Monthly</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-white/40\">payments</span><div><div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest\">Total Paid</div><div class=\"text-white font-semibold text-lg\">R$594.00</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
