 class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs\">Settings</div></div><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-neutral-500 text-sm ml-auto\">settings</span></div></a></aside><script>try{var u=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('user')||'{}');if(u.name){var el=document.getElementById('user-name');if(el)el.textContent=u.name;var ini=document.getElementById('user-initial');if(ini)ini.textContent=u.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase();}}catch(e){}</script>"
